{"evt":"knowledge_added","id":"note-mqazxgxp0yq","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","item":{"fact":"send() return value","value":"send() in daemon.js has no return statement — returns undefined. Dispatcher loop requires truthy return to short-circuit. exec.js and graph.js search use return send() which silently falls through."},"actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-12T14:02:40.769Z"}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqazxgxp0yq","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"orch-gate-bash dispatcher contract bug and security bypasses found in routes split","summary":"Deep review of a247052 found: (1) BLOCKER: send() has no return value → dispatcher fall-through on exec.js (18 sites) + graph.js search (3 sites) → ERR_HTTP_HEADERS_SENT unhandledRejection on every /search /next-action /loop/* /agent* call. Fix: add `return true;` to end of send() in daemon.js. (2) SECURITY: orch-gate-bash.sh has 4 confirmed bypass vectors: redirect-shadowing (cp GATED >/tmp/x), *.log suffix dest, logs/../ path traversal, trailing-comment last-token. Root cause: single-strategy-per-command exemption + no path normalization. (3) Nits: dashboard forces ready on bootedAt change ignoring actual phase; dead autowired=0 in overlay.js; wasted /state fetch in tick_resilient. Routes split otherwise clean: 70+ endpoints preserved, shared state via ctx getters sound.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T14:02:40.765Z","vec":[-0.09875393658876419,0.0323297381401062,0.011541750282049179,0.02111762762069702,0.03624618425965309,0.022153589874505997,-0.018530962988734245,-0.014860879629850388,-0.021677682176232338,0.0331021286547184,0.026954583823680878,0.0069399019703269005,-0.02566012553870678,0.014910794794559479,0.04226621612906456,0.0910283774137497,-0.040027253329753876,-0.0567888543009758,-0.08393271267414093,-0.06434635818004608,-0.035229362547397614,0.019349146634340286,-0.00013835048594046384,0.04549136385321617,-0.05918627977371216,-0.04759201779961586,-0.0447782464325428,-0.023795071989297867,0.039051588624715805,-0.04871220886707306,0.04041064530611038,0.0069544073194265366,-0.1462809443473816,-0.032829731702804565,0.03364467993378639,0.06552132964134216,0.08327654749155045,-0.005519945174455643,-0.026882275938987732,-0.008140940219163895,0.015288315713405609,0.04140207916498184,-0.05126913636922836,-0.02132011391222477,-0.049716003239154816,-0.07220255583